# Release v1.0 – AI Kleinanzeigen Gaming PC Deal Monitor

I'm excited to release the first public version of the **AI-powered Kleinanzeigen Gaming PC Deal Monitor**.

This n8n workflow continuously scans new gaming PC listings from Kleinanzeigen and uses AI to determine whether they're actually good deals—not just listings with attractive titles.

## Features

* Automatic scan every 15 minutes
* Detects complete desktop gaming PCs
* Filters out laptops, single components, wanted ads, and irrelevant listings
* AI extracts CPU, GPU, RAM, storage and other hardware information
* Estimates a realistic used market value
* Performs live market validation
* Ranks every listing based on price and hardware
* Classifies deals into:

  * 🟢 NO-BRAINER
  * 🔵 GOOD DEAL
  * ⚪ NORMAL DEAL
* Sends compact Discord notifications
* Fully built inside n8n

## Requirements

* n8n
* OpenRouter (or another OpenAI-compatible provider)
* Discord Webhook
* Internet connection for live price validation

Configuration is handled through your own credentials and environment variables. No private API keys or webhooks are included in this repository.

## Future Roadmap

Planned improvements include:

* Support for multiple cities
* Multi-category monitoring
* Better AI-based hardware recognition
* Historical price tracking
* Telegram support
* Email notifications
* Web dashboard with statistics
* Automatic duplicate detection across regions

